            "mimeType": "text/html; charset=utf-8",
            "text": "<!--\nDNAM BRANDS\n-->\n<!doctype html>\n<html class='h-full' lang='en-US'>\n  <head>\n    <meta charset='utf-8'>\n    <meta http-equiv='X-UA-Compatible' content='IE=edge'>\n    <meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width,initial-scale=1'>\n    <meta name='theme-color' content='#ece9e2'>\n    <meta name=\"google-site-verification\" content=\"ZNR0Rl2hoA59yYC2Q_tdf2_eZbNlU8MbDxpucmURUTs\" />\n    <link rel='canonical' href='https://www.allbirds.com/products/mens-tree-runner-nz-medium-grey'>\n<meta name='description' content='Allbirds Men&#39;s Tree Runner NZ, breathable sneakers in Limited Edition and Classic colors. FREE shipping &amp; returns. Tree Runner NZ are versatile sneakers, breathable, and constructed from sustainable and recycled materials. Find a review, sizing info, and order online.'>\n<title>Men&#39;s Tree Runner NZ - Everyday Sneakers | Allbirds</title>\n\n\n<meta property='og:site_name' content='Allbirds'>\n<meta property='og:url' content='https://www.allbirds.com/products/mens-tree-runner-nz-medium-grey'>\n<meta property='og:title' content='Men&#39;s Tree Runner NZ - Medium Grey (Blizzard Sole)'>\n<meta property='og:type' content='product'>\n<meta property='og:description' content='The latest iteration of our fan-fave Tree Runner, the Tree Runner NZ nods to our New Zealand roots, tying ten years of innovation together in a shoe as stylish as it is comfortable. Designed with all day wear in mind, it&#39;s the ultimate travel companion.'><meta property='og:image' content='http://www.allbirds.com/cdn/shop/files/A11959_25Q3_Tree_Runner_NZ_Medium_Grey_Blizzard_Sole_PDP_LEFT-2000x2000.png?v=1751898984'>\n  <meta property='og:image:secure_url' content='https://www.allbirds.com/cdn/shop/files/A11959_25Q3_Tree_Runner_NZ_Medium_Grey_Blizzard_Sole_PDP_LEFT-2000x2000.png?v=1751898984'>\n  <meta property='og:image:width' content='2000'>\n  <meta property='og:image:height' content='2000'><meta\n    property='og:price:amount'\n    content