\n  <link rel=\"modulepreload\" href=\"//www.allbirds.com/cdn/shop/t/4159/assets/wunderkind-api.js\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\">\n  <link rel=\"modulepreload\" href=\"//www.allbirds.com/cdn/shop/t/4159/assets/iterable.js\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\">\n  <link rel=\"modulepreload\" href=\"//www.allbirds.com/cdn/shop/t/4159/assets/currency.js\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\">\n  <link rel=\"modulepreload\" href=\"//www.allbirds.com/cdn/shop/t/4159/assets/validator.js\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\">\n  <link rel=\"modulepreload\" href=\"//www.allbirds.com/cdn/shop/t/4159/assets/item-cart-properties.js\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\">\n  <link rel=\"modulepreload\" href=\"//www.allbirds.com/cdn/shop/t/4159/assets/base-section.js\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\">\n  <link rel=\"modulepreload\" href=\"//www.allbirds.com/cdn/shop/t/4159/assets/swiper.js\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\">\n  <link rel=\"modulepreload\" href=\"//www.allbirds.com/cdn/shop/t/4159/assets/create-element-if-not-defined.js\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\">\n  <link rel=\"modulepreload\" href=\"//www.allbirds.com/cdn/shop/t/4159/assets/swiper-core.js\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\">\n  <link rel=\"modulepreload\" href=\"//www.allbirds.com/cdn/shop/t/4159/assets/classes-to-selector.js\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\">\n  <link rel=\"modulepreload\" href=\"//www.allbirds.com/cdn/shop/t/4159/assets/use-scroll-lock.js\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\">\n  <link rel=\"modulepreload\" href=\"//www.allbirds.com/cdn/shop/t/4159/assets/cookies.js\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\">\n  <link rel=\"modulepreload\" href=\"//www.allbirds.com/cdn/shop/t/4159/assets/_commonjsHelpers.js\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\">\n\n\n\n\n</section><section id=\"shopify-section-template--16476865921104__product_details_v2_YXBp9L\" class=\"shopify-section\"><div\n  class='m-2.5 my-10 rounded-lg bg-white opacity-0 shadow-sm lg:rounded-none lg:bg-transparent lg:shadow-none\n'\n  data-section-id='template--16476865921104__product_details_v2_YXBp9L'\n  data-section-template-name='product'\n  data-section-type='product-details-v2'\n  \n  data-product-master-handle='mens-tree-runner-nz'\n  \n><div class='lg:hidden'><div class='border-natural-white' data-accordion='whyWeMadeThis'>\n      <button\n        class='flex w-full items-center justify-between px-4 py-4'\n        @click='handleToggleAccordion(\"whyWeMadeThis\")'\n        type='button'\n        :aria-expanded='accordionStates.whyWeMadeThis ? \"true\" : \"false\"'\n      >\n        <span class='font-mono text-sm tracking-widest text-black uppercase'>WHY WE LOVE THIS</span>\n        <span class='relative size-4 cursor-pointer'>\n          <span class='absolute top-1/2 left-0 h-px w-4 -translate-y-1/2 bg-current'></span>\n          <span\n            class='absolute top-1/2 left-0 h-px w-4 origin-center -translate-y-1/2 bg-current transition-transform duration-300'\n            :class='accordionStates.whyWeMadeThis ? \"rotate-0\" : \"rotate-90\"'\n          ></span>\n        </span>\n      </button>\n      <div class='overflow-hidden' data-accordion-content='whyWeMadeThis'>\n        <div class='px-4 pb-8'><p class='font-geograph text-base text-black'>The latest iteration of our fan-fave Tree Runner nods to our New Zealand roots, tying ten years of innovation together in a shoe as stylish as it is comfortable. Offering a slightly more structured build than the original, this light, breathable, sneaker is made to move.</p><div class='mt-8'>\n              <h3 class='font-mono text-sm tracking-widest text-black uppercase'>\n                Thoughtfully designed\n              </h3>\n              <ul class='mt-3 list-disc pl-5'><li class='font-geograph mb-2 text-sm/[21px] text-black'>\n                    <strong>Breathable TENCEL™ Lyocell (tree fiber)</strong> and recycled polyester blend upper for a light, cool feel\n                  </li><li class='font-geograph mb-2 text-sm/[21px] text-black'>\n                    Sugarcane-based <strong>SweetFoam® cushioning</strong> with responsive energy return\n                  </li><li class='font-geograph mb-2 text-sm/[21px] text-black'>\n                    <strong>Soft, Merino-wool</strong> blend lining\n                  </li><li class='font-geograph mb-2 text-sm/[21px] text-black'>\n                    Plush <strong>Featherbed™ memory foam </strong>insole for extra comfort and bounce\n                  </li></ul>\n            </div><div class='mt-8'>\n              <h3 class='font-mono text-sm tracking-widest text-black uppercase'>\n                Best for\n              </h3>\n              <div class='mt-3 flex flex-wrap gap-2'><span class='bg-natural-white-60 font-geograph rounded-full px-2 py-1 text-sm text-black'>Traveling</span><span class='bg-natural-white-60 font-geograph rounded-full px-2 py-1 text-sm text-black'>Walking</span><span class='bg-natural-white-60 font-geograph rounded-full px-2 py-1 text-sm text-black'>Commuting</span><span class='bg-natural-white-60 font-geograph rounded-full px-2 py-1 text-sm text-black'>Everyday</span></div>\n            </div><div class='mt-8'>\n            <button\n              class='text-light-charcoal flex items-center gap-2'\n              @click='handleToggleTechDetails'\n              type='button'\n            >\n              <span\n                class='transition-transform duration-300'\n                :class='showTechDetails ? \"rotate-90\" : \"\"'\n              ><svg\n  class='size-6'\n  fill='none'\n  viewBox='0 0 24 24'\n  xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'\n><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10.1464 7.52512C10.3417 7.32986 10.6583 7.32986 10.8536 7.52512L15.0962 11.7678C15.2915 11.963 15.2915 12.2796 15.0962 12.4749L10.8536 16.7175C10.6583 16.9128 10.3417 16.9128 10.1464 16.7175C9.95118 16.5222 9.95118 16.2057 10.1464 16.0104L14.0355 12.1213L10.1464 8.23223C9.95118 8.03697 9.95118 7.72039 10.1464 7.52512Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></svg>\n</span>\n              <span\n                class='font-geograph text-sm underline'\n                v-text='showTechDetails ? \"Hide technical details\" : \"View technical details\"'\n              ></span>\n            </button><ul\n                class='mt-4 h-0 list-disc overflow-hidden pl-10 opacity-0'\n                data-mobile-tech-details\n              ><li class='font-geograph mb-2 text-sm/[21px] text-black'>\n                    <strong>Weight:</strong> 8.9oz (M9), 7.1oz (W7)\n                  </li><li class='font-geograph mb-2 text-sm/[21px] text-black'>\n                    <strong>Stack Height:</strong> Heel: 20mm Toe: 10.2mm\n                  </li><li class='font-geograph mb-2 text-sm/[21px] text-black'>\n                    <strong>Heel/Toe Drop:</strong> 9.8mm\n                  </li><li class='font-geograph mb-2 text-sm/[21px] text-black'>\n                    <strong>Country of Origin:</strong> Vietnam\n                  </li></ul></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div><div class='border-natural-white border-t' data-accordion='materials'>\n        <button\n          class='flex w-full items-center justify-between px-4 py-4'\n          @click='handleToggleAccordion(\"materials\")'\n          type='button'\n          :aria-expanded='accordionStates.materials ? \"true\" : \"false\"'\n        >\n          <span class='font-mono text-sm tracking-widest text-black uppercase'>\n            Materials & Sustainability\n          </span>\n          <span class='relative size-4 cursor-pointer'>\n            <span class='absolute top-1/2 left-0 h-px w-4 -translate-y-1/2 bg-current'></span>\n            <span\n              class='absolute top-1/2 left-0 h-px w-4 origin-center -translate-y-1/2 bg-current transition-transform duration-300'\n              :class='accordionStates.materials ? \"rotate-0\" : \"rotate-90\"'\n            ></span>\n          </span>\n        </button>\n        <div class='overflow-hidden' data-accordion-content='materials'>\n          <div class='flex flex-col gap-6 px-3 pb-6'><div class='flex items-center gap-5 pr-2'><div class='relative size-[72px] shrink-0'>\n                    <div class='border-natural-white absolute inset-0 rounded-full border'></div>\n                    \n\n  \n  <img\n    fetchpriority='auto'\n    alt=''\n    class='absolute inset-1 size-16 rounded-full object-cover'\n    height='1024'\n    loading='lazy'\n    src='//www.allbirds.com/cdn/shop/files/PDP_Materials_Tree_600x600_41d4fd06-223d-4bcd-8f95-f93fa6f6fa23.jpg?v=1772058463&width=1024'\n    width='1024'\n    \n    \n    \n    \n    \n  >\n\n\n                  </div><div class='flex flex-col gap-1'>\n                  <div class='flex items-baseline gap-1'><span class='font-geograph text-light-charcoal text-xs'>Upper</span><span class='text-sm font-medium text-black'>Tree Knit</span></div><p class='font-geograph text-sm/5 text-black'>Knit upper made from eucalyptus-derived TENCEL™ Lyocell (tree fiber) yarn and recycled polyester blend</p></div>\n              </div><div class='flex items-center gap-5 pr-2'><div class='relative size-[72px] shrink-0'>\n                    <div class='border-natural-white absolute inset-0 rounded-full border'></div>\n                    \n\n  \n  <img\n    fetchpriority='auto'\n    alt=''\n    class='absolute inset-1 size-16 rounded-full object-cover'\n    height='1024'\n    loading='lazy'\n    src='//www.allbirds.com/cdn/shop/files/PDP_Materials_Sugarcane_600x600_cfb05fbd-72b3-4e38-82f1-a1b2f4769c8b.jpg?v=1772058166&width=1024'\n    width='1024'\n    \n    \n    \n    \n    \n  >\n\n\n                  </div><div class='flex flex-col gap-1'>\n                  <div class='flex items-baseline gap-1'><span class='font-geograph text-light-charcoal text-xs'>Midsole</span><span class='text-sm font-medium text-black'>SweetFoam®</span></div><p class='font-geograph text-sm/5 text-black'>SweetFoam® sugarcane-based EVA foam provides comfort and durability while being light on the planet</p></div>\n              </div><div class='flex items-center gap-5 pr-2'><div class='relative size-[72px] shrink-0'>\n                    <div class='border-natural-white absolute inset-0 rounded-full border'></div>\n                    \n\n  \n  <img\n    fetchpriority='auto'\n    alt=''\n    class='absolute inset-1 size-16 rounded-full object-cover'\n    height='1024'\n    loading='lazy'\n    src='//www.allbirds.com/cdn/shop/files/PDP_Materials_RecycledPlastic_600x600_93ac2398-4951-4eeb-9297-748c56da3bdb.jpg?v=1772059600&width=1024'\n    width='1024'\n    \n    \n    \n    \n    \n  >\n\n\n                  </div><div class='flex flex-col gap-1'>\n                  <div class='flex items-baseline gap-1'><span class='font-geograph text-light-charcoal text-xs'>Laces</span><span class='text-sm font-medium text-black'>Recycled Polyester</span></div><p class='font-geograph text-sm/5 text-black'>100% recycled polyester laces sourced from plastic bottles</p></div>\n              </div></div>\n        </div>\n      </div><div class='border-natural-white border-t' data-accordion='care'>\n        <button\n          class='flex w-full items-center justify-between px-4 py-4'\n          @click='handleToggleAccordion(\"care\")'\n          type='button'\n          :aria-expanded='accordionStates.care ? \"true\" : \"false\"'\n        >\n          <span class='font-mono text-sm tracking-widest text-black uppercase'>\n            Care instructions\n          </span>\n          <span class='relative size-4 cursor-pointer'>\n            <span class='absolute top-1/2 left-0 h-px w-4 -translate-y-1/2 bg-current'></span>\n            <span\n              class='absolute top-1/2 left-0 h-px w-4 origin-center -translate-y-1/2 bg-current transition-transform duration-300'\n              :class='accordionStates.care ? \"rotate-0\" : \"rotate-90\"'\n            ></span>\n          </span>\n        </button>\n        <div class='overflow-hidden' data-accordion-content='care'>\n          <div class='px-3 pb-6'><div class='font-geograph mt-2 text-sm/5 text-black [&_ul]:flex [&_ul]:list-disc [&_ul]:flex-col [&_ul]:gap-2 [&_ul]:pl-5'>\n              <p>Yes, they’re machine washable. Remove the insoles, hand wash those separately, and let everything air dry. Fresh again.</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div v-show='isReviewsSectionVisible' v-cloak class='border-natural-white border-t px-4 py-4'>\n        <button\n          class='yotpo-sr-bottom-line-summary yotpo-sr-bottom-line-button flex w-full cursor-pointer gap-1'\n          @click='goToReviews'\n          aria-label='Go to reviews'\n        >\n          <span class='font-mono text-sm tracking-widest text-black uppercase'>Reviews</span>\n          <div class='mr-auto'>\n            <div\n  data-key='product-details-v2-mobile'\n  data-yotpo-star-ratings-widget\n  class='yotpo-widget-instance min-h-[18px]'\n  data-yotpo-instance-id='773533'\n  data-yotpo-product-id='7188363575376'\n></div>\n\n          </div>\n          <span class='relative size-4'>\n            <span class='absolute top-1/2 left-0 h-px w-4 bg-current'></span>\n            <span\n              class='absolute top-1/2 left-0 h-px w-4 origin-center rotate-90 bg-current'\n            ></span>\n          </span>\n        </button>\n      </div>\n    \n  </div><div class='hidden lg:block'><div class='rounded-3xl bg-white px-7 shadow-sm' data-desktop-accordion='whyWeMadeThis'>\n      <button\n        class='flex w-full items-center justify-between py-6'\n        @click='handleToggleDesktopAccordion(\"whyWeMadeThis\")'\n        type='button'\n        :aria-expanded='desktopAccordionStates.whyWeMadeThis ? \"true\" : \"false\"'\n      >\n        <span class='font-mono text-base tracking-widest uppercase'>WHY WE LOVE THIS</span>\n        <span class='relative size-4 cursor-pointer'>\n          <span class='absolute top-1/2 left-0 h-px w-4 -translate-y-1/2 bg-current'></span>\n          <span\n            class='absolute top-1/2 left-0 h-px w-4 origin-center -translate-y-1/2 bg-current transition-transform duration-300'\n            :class='desktopAccordionStates.whyWeMadeThis ? \"rotate-0\" : \"rotate-90\"'\n          ></span>\n        </span>\n      </button>\n      <div data-desktop-accordion-content='whyWeMadeThis'>\n        <div class='relative flex items-center justify-center gap-8 pb-4'><div class='w-1/3 max-w-[400px]'><div class='overflow-hidden' data-tech-description><p class='font-geograph text-lg/7 text-black'>The latest iteration of our fan-fave Tree Runner nods to our New Zealand roots, tying ten years of innovation together in a shoe as stylish as it is comfortable. Offering a slightly more structured build than the original, this light, breathable, sneaker is made to move.</p></div><div class='mt-8' data-tech-best-for>\n                <h3 class='text-light-charcoal font-mono text-sm tracking-widest uppercase'>\n                  Best for\n                </h3>\n                <div class='mt-4 mb-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3'><span class='bg-natural-white-60 font-geograph rounded-full px-2 py-1 text-sm text-black select-none'>Traveling</span><span class='bg-natural-white-60 font-geograph rounded-full px-2 py-1 text-sm text-black select-none'>Walking</span><span class='bg-natural-white-60 font-geograph rounded-full px-2 py-1 text-sm text-black select-none'>Commuting</span><span class='bg-natural-white-60 font-geograph rounded-full px-2 py-1 text-sm text-black select-none'>Everyday</span></div>\n              </div><div>\n              <button\n                class='text-light-charcoal flex items-center gap-2'\n                @click='handleToggleTechDetails'\n                type='button'\n              >\n                <span\n                  class='transition-transform duration-300'\n                  :class='showTechDetails ? \"rotate-90\" : \"\"'\n                ><svg\n  class='size-6'\n  fill='none'\n  viewBox='0 0 24 24'\n  xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'\n><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10.146