 </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div v-show='isReviewsSectionVisible' v-cloak class='border-natural-white border-t px-4 py-4'>\n        <button\n          class='yotpo-sr-bottom-line-summary yotpo-sr-bottom-line-button flex w-full cursor-pointer gap-1'\n          @click='goToReviews'\n          aria-label='Go to reviews'\n        >\n          <span class='font-mono text-sm tracking-widest text-black uppercase'>Reviews</span>\n          <div class='mr-auto'>\n            <div\n  data-key='product-details-v2-mobile'\n  data-yotpo-star-ratings-widget\n  class='yotpo-widget-instance min-h-[18px]'\n  data-yotpo-instance-id='773533'\n  data-yotpo-product-id='7188363575376'\n></div>\n\n          </div>\n          <span class='relative size-4'>\n            <span class='absolute top-1/2 left-0 h-px w-4 bg-current'></span>\n            <span\n              class='absolute top-1/2 left-0 h-px w-4 origin-center rotate-90 bg-current'\n            ></span>\n          </span>\n        </button>\n      </div>\n    \n  </div><div class='hidden lg:block'><div class='rounded-3xl bg-white px-7 shadow-sm' data-desktop-accordion='whyWeMadeThis'>\n      <button\n        class='flex w-full items-center justify-between py-6'\n        @click='handleToggleDesktopAccordion(\"whyWeMadeThis\")'\n        type='button'\n        :aria-expanded='desktopAccordionStates.whyWeMadeThis ? \"true\" : \"false\"'\n      >\n        <span class='font-mono text-base tracking-widest uppercase'>WHY WE LOVE THIS</span>\n        <span class='relative size-4 cursor-pointer'>\n          <span class='absolute top-1/2 left-0 h-px w-4 -translate-y-1/2 bg-current'></span>\n          <span\n            class='absolute top-1/2 left-0 h-px w-4 origin-center -translate-y-1/2 bg-current transition-transform duration-300'\n            :class='desktopAccordionStates.whyWeMadeThis ? \"rotate-0\" : \"rotate-90\"'\n          ></span>\n        </span>\n      </button>\n      <div data-desktop-accordion-content='whyWeMadeThis'>\n        <div class='relative flex items-center justify-center gap-8 pb-4'><div class='w-1/3 max-w-[400px]'><div class='overflow-hidden' data-tech-description><p class='font-geograph text-lg/7 text-black'>Soft as your favorite tee, and built for all day wear, our new Jersey Runner NZ is always a good call. Built to breathe, with zero break in required, they’ll feel like you’ve had them forever. If summer had an official uniform, these would be part of it.</p></div><div class='mt-8' data-tech-best-for>\n                <h3 class='text-light-charcoal font-mono text-sm tracking-widest uppercase'>\n                  Best for\n                </h3>\n                <div class='mt-4 mb-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3'><span class='bg-natural-white-60 font-geograph rounded-full px-2 py-1 text-sm text-black select-none'>Weekends</span><span class='bg-natural-white-60 font-geograph rounded-full px-2 py-1 text-sm text-black select-none'>Hanging out</span><span class='bg-natural-white-60 font-geograph rounded-full px-2 py-1 text-sm text-black select-none'>Post-workout</span></div>\n              </div><div>\n              <button\n                class='text-light-charcoal flex items-center gap-2'\n                @click='handleToggleTechDetails'\n                type='button'\n              >\n                <span\n                  class='transition-transform duration-300'\n                  :class='showTechDetails ? \"rotate-90\" : \"\"'\n                ><svg\n  class='size-6'\n  fill='none'\n  viewBox='0 0 24 24'\n  xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'\n><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10.1464 7.52512C10.3417 7.32986 10.6583 7.32986 10.8536 7.52512L15.0962 11.7678C15.2915 11.963 15.2915 12.2796 15.0962 12.4749L10.8536 16.7175C10.6583 16.9128 10.3417 16.9128 10.1464 16.7175C9.95118 16.5222 9.95118 16.2057 10.1464 16.0104L14.0355 12.1213L10.1464 8.23223C9.95118 8.03697 9.95118 7.72039 10.1464 7.52512Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></svg>\n</span>\n                <span\n                  class='font-geograph cursor-pointer text-sm underline'\n                  v-text='showTechDetails ? \"Hide technical details\" : \"View technical details\"'\n                ></span>\n              </button>\n            </div><div class='overflow-hidden pt-4' data-tech-details>\n                <ul class='list-disc pl-10'><li class='font-geograph mb-3 text-base/6 text-black'>\n                      <strong>Weight:</strong> 9.1oz (M9)\n                    </li><li class='font-geograph mb-3 text-base/6 text-black'>\n                      <strong>Stack Height:</strong> Heel: 20mm Toe: 10.2mm\n                    </li><li class='font-geograph mb-3 text-base/6 text-black'>\n                      <strong>Heel/Toe Drop:</strong> 9.8mm\n                    </li><li class='font-geograph mb-3 text-base/6 text-black'>\n                      <strong>Country of Origin:</strong> Vietnam\n                    </li></ul>\n              </div></div><div class='size-fill relative inset-0  m-0 aspect-square w-1/3 max-w-[600px] grow'>\n              <div class='pointer-events-none absolute inset-0'>\n                <div class='absolute inset-0 m-auto aspect-square w-[87%]'>\n                  <div\n                    class='border-natural-white absolute inset-0 rounded-full border opacity-50'\n                  ></div>\n                  <div\n                    class='border-natural-white absolute inset-4 rounded-full border opacity-50'\n                  ></div>\n                  <div class='bg-natural-white-60 absolute inset-8 rounded-full'></div>\n                </div>\n                \n\n  \n  <img\n    fetchpriority='auto'\n    alt=''\n    class='absolute inset-8 size-[calc(100%-64px)] object-contain'\n    height='1024'\n    loading='lazy'\n    src='//www.allbirds.com/cdn/shop/files/A12561_26Q1_Runner-NZ-Jersey-Light-Grey-Anthracite-Blizzard-Sole_PDP_PAIR_3Q_505c32a3-c3b5-4964-9be4-a404298d2ee5.png?v=1774566541&width=1024'