             </div></div>\n          \n\n          <div class='mt-auto w-full'>\n            \n              <div class='mb-6 flex flex-col items-center gap-2 md:flex-row md:gap-5'>\n                \n                  <h3 class='text-center text-sm font-medium text-black uppercase'>Our Shoes are Unisex</h3>\n                \n\n                \n                  <p class='text-light-charcoal text-center text-sm leading-none md:text-xs'>If you wear a women's size 11.5-12, try a men's size 10.5-11. If you wear a men's size 7-7.5, try a women's size 8-8.5.</p>\n                \n              </div>\n            \n\n            \n<div class='relative mb-6 block w-full'>\n                  <div\n                    class='scrollbar-hidden border-light-charcoal-0.3 w-full overflow-x-auto rounded-[20px] border'\n                    ref='tableContainerRef'\n                  >\n                    <div\n                      role='table'\n                      aria-label='Size Chart Table'\n                      class='flex w-full md:block'\n                      data-size-chart-table\n                    >\n\n\n                          <div\n                            role='row'\n                            aria-label='Row 3'\n                            class='flex w-full flex-col md:w-auto md:flex-row'\n                          >\n\n                                <div class='flex  h-full items-center bg-natural-white-60 text-sm py-3 flex-row md:flex-col w-full min-w-[70px] justify-center px-4 text-center text-gray-700 first:min-w-[55px] first:text-left first:font-medium first:text-black'>\n                                  \nUS\n                                </div>\n\n                                <div class='flex  bg-white text-sm py-3 flex-row md:flex-col w-full min-w-[70px] justify-center px-4 text-center text-gray-700 first:min-w-[55px] first:text-left first:font-medium first:text-black'>\n                                  \n8\n                            